{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speed drills made fun!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice your math facts through several games. These games have been designed to both challenge and improve your mental math skills. Work your way up through an ascending number progression, starting with 1's all the way to 20s in all four foundational arithmetic operations - addition, subtraction, multiplication, and division.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress and Achievement</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This app encourages users with advancement and achievement, but all the progress made in-app also means real-life skills are being made. Show off what you've learned with this family-friendly app and improve your mental math skills today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeling competitive? Strive to reach to top of the global or local leaderboards in your favorite mini-game!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Solve 100 Problems","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3531680/db64ebbebf716a2abc5aeae78b981c04f9ab1014.jpg"},{"name":"Solve 200 Problems","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3531680/7f45e1852d82a89fe1a32b2b91c334b70f3d7256.jpg"},{"name":"Solve 500 Problems","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3531680/d54cdc00bc22a0391b519c115f374aad64b06047.jpg"},{"name":"Solve 1000 Problems","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3531680/a3a733b6fb26e523c12325919b9b986dd998ab6a.jpg"},{"name":"Bronze Frog","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3531680/309280f72f1f35c59d7846918fde7763ca43da7e.jpg"},{"name":"Silver Frog","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3531680/296311c56